ONI Web adaptation, 2026-10-15: browser session/profile management, a FastAPI
gateway with encrypted storage, web security and lifecycle protections, browser
IPC in place of Tauri, Python operation adapters, and a headless native helper.
Original source provenance and modification details are in backend/vendor/UPSTREAM.md.

